      "voice_id": "f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2",
      "gain": 1,
      "source_text": "See? We've got a promising future.",
      "scene": "Before There Were Secrets",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2/id=aeb269bebc9b4b05aebe881947b6b2c5.wav",
      "duration": 2.7718367346938777
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "line-067",
      "run_id": 64,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_id": "a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa",
      "gain": 1,
      "source_text": "She slept easier that night. Not because the world had become safe, but because someone had stayed outside the door. Cassian wasn't an angel. He forgot appointments. He borrowed things and returned them in odd places. He could turn a five-minute errand into a two-hour adventure, usually involving somebody's broken car and an extremely unconvincing explanation.",
      "scene": "Before There Were Secrets",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa/id=089fd433caa949548cca62c4a0e49256.wav",
      "duration": 21.039433106575963
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "line-068",
      "run_id": 64,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_id": "a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa",
      "gain": 1,
      "source_text": "When Ninja was fifteen, he forgot the afternoon they'd planned to see a film together. She waited at the cinema entrance for forty minutes before walking home alone. He arrived later, wet from rain, carrying two paper bags of takeaway and a look that was halfway between guilt and fear of what she'd do to him.",
      "scene": "The Person Who Stayed",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa/id=304fe56475904be39678e4e2822b7e94.wav",
      "duration": 17.17331065759637
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "line-069",
      "run_id": 65,
      "speaker": "cassian",
      "voice_id": "f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2",
      "gain": 1,
      "source_text": "I know.",
      "scene": "The Person Who Stayed",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2/id=f04a5dd5c63440068ab3b174493de7d3.wav",
      "duration": 0.9189115646258503
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "line-070",
